Locking in that upcoming wedding project requires a premium feel. Expanding this into a multi-section scrolling experience with elegant scroll animations will give it the same polished touch as those previous customized invitation variants you've successfully hosted on GitHub Pages. 

 To accommodate the maroon and gold text requirement without losing the light blue color palette from image_7bf85c.png , this layout shifts into a "Royal Pastel" aesthetic. Deep maroon ( #601010 ) completely replaces all black text for high readability, while a metallic gold ( #C5A059 ) is used for the names, buttons, and borders. 

 I’ve also added a full welcome section, separated the details into a beautiful floating card, and added a jQuery script that triggers a smooth fade-in animation as the user scrolls down the page. 

