 3. A Word of Caution (The Reality Check) 

 Using exec() allows the LangGraph agent to write and run actual Python scripts on your MacBook. This is incredibly powerful, but it means if the AI writes a script like import os; os.remove("important_file.txt") , your computer will actually execute it. 

 Because you are building this locally for your own use, it is fine! But this is why the Sandbox step you designed is so critical. You must verify the code before saying "yes" to promote it. 

