 2. Update style.css 

 Follow these steps carefully to merge the new styles with your existing ones. 

 A. Add New Keyframes 
Add this @keyframes rule to the very end of your style.css file. 

 @keyframes sparkle {
 50% {
 transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(var(--s, 1));
 }
}

 B. Update Button Group Styles 
 Replace your entire block of CSS from .cta-button-group down to .btn-group-linkedin:hover i with the new code block below. 

 This new block merges the animation logic (like color: transparent , --hover , and --pos ) with your existing styles and removes the conflicting overflow: hidden and ::before pseudo-element. 

 /* REPLACE all of your .cta-button-group and .btn-group-* rules with this block */
.cta-button-group {
