 Suggestions for Future Improvements 

 Dark Mode Toggle: Developers love dark mode. Since CSS variables are already set up ( :root ), implementing dark mode is as simple as adding a [data-theme="dark"] selector that overrides those color variables with dark equivalents ( #0f172a , #1e293b , etc.). 

