 The Deployment Playbook (To get the "Native App" feel): 

 Push all four files ( index.html , data.json , manifest.json , sw.js ) and your Personality.svg to Vercel. 

 Open the Vercel URL on your iPhone using Safari. 

 Tap the Share icon at the bottom of Safari and tap "Add to Home Screen" . 

 Close Safari. 

 Go to your iPhone home screen, find the new FitForge icon, and tap it. It will open as a full-screen application. 

 Would you like to review the code, or should we talk about linking your custom domain to that Vercel project?

This is a great request. We will pivot from the "Theatre/Curtain" theme to a "Divine Mandala & Asymmetric Modern" theme. 

 The New Concept: "The Golden Gateway" 

 The Reveal: Instead of curtains, we will use a Mandala Zoom . A giant, intricate golden Mandala spins in the center. When clicked, we fly through the center of the Mandala into the website. 

 The Layout: Instead of a standard centered layout, we will use Asymmetric Typography (Magazine Style) for a more modern, high-end feel. 

 The Animation: We will upgrade to GSAP ScrollTrigger (I will add the CDN) to create a "Drawing Line" effect for the timeline and parallax scrolling. 

 Here is your completely new design package. 

 1. index.html 

 Changes: 

 Added ScrollTrigger CDN. 

 New Mandala Loader structure. 

 New Asymmetric Hero layout. 

 New Zig-Zag Timeline structure. 

 <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
