 </div>
 </div>

 <hr>
 <div id="agentDetails" class="mt-3">
 <h5 class="card-title">Agent Details</h5>
 <p id="agentDescription" class="text-muted small mb-2">Select an agent to see details.</p>
 <div id="llmInfo" class="mt-3" style="display: none;">
 <strong>Model:</strong> <span id="llmModel" class="badge bg-info text-dark"></span>
