 We will create Version 3: "The Sacred Scroll" (Patrika Style) . 

 The Concept: "The Royal Farman" 

 Instead of a full-screen website, the content sits on a continuous, long parchment scroll that floats in the center of the screen against a dark royal background (like a table). 

 The Reveal: A "Kalava" (Sacred Thread) runs horizontally across the screen, tying the scroll shut. You must click the knot to "untie" it. The thread snaps, and the scroll unfurls downwards. 

 The Vibe: Ancient, literary, and deeply traditional. Like reading a royal decree. 

 Visuals: Ragged paper edges, ink-bleed animations for text, and "stamped" images. 

