 Glassmorphism & Blurs: Soft, frosted-glass floating headers and navigation. 

 Micro-Interactions: Smooth cubic-bezier animations when tapping items. 

 The "Bottom Sheet" Modal: Instead of a clunky pop-up, the customization menu slides up smoothly from the bottom, complete with image thumbnails for every single add-on . 

 Dynamic Rendering: As a senior dev, you don't write 20 HTML cards. You write a JSON array and let JavaScript render the DOM. This makes the app lightning fast. 

 Here are the two distinct systems. Save these as two separate files. 

 1. The Customer App ( shop.html ) 

 This is the modern, animated, mobile-first (but desktop-beautiful) storefront. It features 18 Indian and Western items, category filtering, and the image-rich customization drawer. 

