Claymorphism is a fantastic design choice. It takes the dark, aggressive gym vibe and makes it feel incredibly premium, tactile, and modern. 

 To pull off genuine Claymorphism, we have to eliminate hard borders and flat backgrounds. Instead, we use a combination of two inner shadows (one light, one dark) and an outer drop shadow to make the elements look like fluffy, inflated 3D clay floating on the screen. 

 Here is the complete, upgraded index.html file. I have completely rewritten the CSS to inject a "Midnight Clay" aesthetic while maintaining every single functional feature (PWA, Voice, Sets, Gamification) and the animated gradient you loved. 

 The Claymorphism Update ( index.html ) 

