 You see a Rich Crimson Fabric screen with a gold thread running across. 

 It looks like a sealed envelope or gift wrap. 

 Clicking the knot feels satisfying—it shakes, drops, and the string snaps open violently before the fabric slides away to reveal the paper scroll. 

 This is the Sacred Scroll experience.

This is the perfect approach. We will pivot from the "Theatrical/Royal" look of V1 to a "Divine Modern Minimalist" look for V2. 

